- [x] "Lessons with file glob anchors match files whose paths match the glob" → Step 2 (file matching) + Step 4 test 1
- [x] "Lessons with import pattern anchors match files that import a matching path" → Step 2 (import matching) + Step 4 test 2
- [x] "Lessons with directory glob anchors match files under the matching directory" → Step 2 (directory matching) + Step 4 test 3
